      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "The fluid in Bristlebane's pustules is harmful to other creatures. Whenever a creature hits Bristlebane with a melee attack, the attacker must succeed at a DC 14 Reflex save save or take 1 acid damage (2 acid damage on a critical failure)."
