      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Bristlebane makes a whip Strike against one creature within reach, on a success she pulls the target into an adjacent square. This is forced movement. She then Strikes the pulled target with her jaws. Both attacks count against her multiple attack penalty but don't apply until after both attacks."
