    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Whip Whirlwind",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Bristlebane uses her whip to Disarm, Strike, or Trip each creature within her reach. She can select a different action for each target. She takes a -2 circumstance penalty on the check for each action, and each action counts against her multiple attack penalty, but her multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after all the actions.",
